{"page":34,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"26","words":[{"text":"26","x":182,"y":138,"width":52,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 01 • 컴퓨터 네트워크와 인터넷","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":586,"y":143,"width":131,"height":26},{"text":"01","x":728,"y":144,"width":32,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":797,"y":151,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":844,"y":144,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크와","x":935,"y":144,"width":134,"height":29},{"text":"인터넷","x":1080,"y":141,"width":80,"height":31}]},{"text":"로 패킷을 보내고자 할 때 에던 일이 벌어지는지 고려해 보자. 회선 교한괴 마찬가지로","words":[{"text":"로","x":559,"y":272,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"패킷을","x":608,"y":269,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"보내고자","x":727,"y":270,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"할","x":879,"y":271,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":926,"y":271,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"에던","x":974,"y":270,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"일이","x":1057,"y":269,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"벌어지는지","x":1138,"y":267,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"고려해","x":1323,"y":267,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"보자.","x":1440,"y":267,"width":76,"height":37},{"text":"회선","x":1534,"y":267,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"교한괴","x":1617,"y":267,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":1736,"y":266,"width":167,"height":39}]},{"text":"패킷은 일련의 통신 링크를 통해서 전송된다. 그러나 회선 교원과 달리 패킷은 랑그 자","words":[{"text":"패킷은","x":560,"y":328,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"일련의","x":680,"y":327,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"통신","x":795,"y":329,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"링크를","x":879,"y":329,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"통해서","x":992,"y":328,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"전송된다.","x":1112,"y":326,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":1271,"y":326,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"회선","x":1390,"y":325,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"교원과","x":1471,"y":325,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"달리","x":1591,"y":326,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"패킷은","x":1675,"y":325,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"랑그","x":1795,"y":325,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"자","x":1872,"y":330,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"원을 예약하지 않고 네트워크로 보내진다. 만약에 그 시긴에 링그상으로 다른 피|것들","words":[{"text":"원을","x":558,"y":387,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"예약하지","x":645,"y":387,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"않고","x":800,"y":388,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크로","x":885,"y":389,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"보내진다.","x":1071,"y":385,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"만약에","x":1236,"y":385,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1354,"y":390,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"시긴에","x":1406,"y":384,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"링그상으로","x":1529,"y":384,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1720,"y":384,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"피|것들","x":1805,"y":384,"width":97,"height":42}]},{"text":"이 전송되어야 하기 때문에 링크 중 하나가 혼잡하다면, 그 패킷은 전송 링크의 송신","words":[{"text":"이","x":557,"y":446,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"전송되어야","x":609,"y":447,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"하기","x":799,"y":448,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"때문에","x":883,"y":447,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":1004,"y":446,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"중","x":1087,"y":448,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"하나가","x":1137,"y":444,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡하다면,","x":1256,"y":443,"width":183,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1457,"y":447,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"패킷은","x":1509,"y":443,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"전송","x":1633,"y":443,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"링크의","x":1720,"y":443,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":1837,"y":445,"width":62,"height":42}]},{"text":"쪽의 버퍼에서 기다려야 하고 지연이 발생한다. 인터넷은 최대한 빠르게 패킷을 전날","words":[{"text":"쪽의","x":553,"y":507,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼에서","x":642,"y":506,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"기다려야","x":798,"y":506,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"하고","x":950,"y":506,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"지연이","x":1035,"y":505,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"발생한다.","x":1153,"y":504,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷은","x":1319,"y":503,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"최대한","x":1474,"y":503,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"빠르게","x":1595,"y":503,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1719,"y":503,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"전날","x":1838,"y":506,"width":64,"height":41}]},{"text":"하려고 최선을 다하지만 일정 시간 내에 전딜히는 것을 보장하지 않는다.","words":[{"text":"하려고","x":553,"y":566,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"최선을","x":674,"y":567,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"다하지만","x":790,"y":566,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"일정","x":941,"y":565,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1021,"y":565,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"내에","x":1104,"y":565,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"전딜히는","x":1186,"y":563,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1339,"y":563,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"보장하지","x":1419,"y":562,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":1575,"y":562,"width":112,"height":39}]},{"text":"회선 교환 네트위크에서의 다중화","words":[{"text":"회선","x":552,"y":669,"width":73,"height":43},{"text":"교환","x":635,"y":671,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"네트위크에서의","x":720,"y":670,"width":247,"height":37},{"text":"다중화","x":981,"y":669,"width":108,"height":43}]},{"text":"링크 내 한 회선은 주파수-분할 다중회\u003cfrequency-division multiplexing, FDM) 혹","words":[{"text":"링크","x":553,"y":742,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"내","x":636,"y":742,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":683,"y":743,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"회선은","x":732,"y":742,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"주파수-분할","x":847,"y":740,"width":203,"height":39},{"text":"다중회\u003cfrequency-division","x":1062,"y":740,"width":436,"height":41},{"text":"multiplexing,","x":1511,"y":745,"width":228,"height":38},{"text":"FDM)","x":1752,"y":747,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"혹","x":1867,"y":747,"width":33,"height":38}]},{"text":"은 시-분할 다중회(time-division multiplexing, TDM)로 구현된다. FDM에서 링크","words":[{"text":"은","x":549,"y":803,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"시-분할","x":600,"y":802,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"다중회(time-division","x":747,"y":801,"width":335,"height":40},{"text":"multiplexing,","x":1096,"y":805,"width":225,"height":37},{"text":"TDM)로","x":1334,"y":805,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"구현된다.","x":1493,"y":803,"width":150,"height":38},{"text":"FDM에서","x":1661,"y":805,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":1836,"y":807,"width":63,"height":37}]},{"text":"를 통해 설정된 연결은 그 링크의 주파수 스펙트럼을 공유한다. 특히 그 링크는 연결되","words":[{"text":"를","x":548,"y":865,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"통해","x":596,"y":863,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"설정된","x":680,"y":862,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"연결은","x":797,"y":862,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":911,"y":867,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"링크의","x":961,"y":862,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"주파수","x":1075,"y":862,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"스펙트럼을","x":1193,"y":862,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"공유한다.","x":1382,"y":864,"width":150,"height":38},{"text":"특히","x":1548,"y":865,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1632,"y":870,"width":35,"height":25},{"text":"링크는","x":1683,"y":865,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"연결되","x":1802,"y":866,"width":94,"height":42}]},{"text":"는 동안 각 연결에 대해 주파수 대역을 고정 제공한다. 전화망에서의 이 주파수 대역은","words":[{"text":"는","x":547,"y":926,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"동안","x":594,"y":923,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":678,"y":923,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"연결에","x":726,"y":922,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":842,"y":922,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"주파수","x":922,"y":922,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"대역을","x":1042,"y":922,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"고정","x":1157,"y":923,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1241,"y":923,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"전화망에서의","x":1407,"y":925,"width":208,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1634,"y":925,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"주파수","x":1680,"y":927,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"대역은","x":1801,"y":927,"width":99,"height":40}]},{"text":"일반적으로 4 kHz(4,()0() Hz 혹은 초당 4,(脚사이클) 폭을 갖는다. 이런 대역의 폭을","words":[{"text":"일반적으로","x":549,"y":984,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"4","x":733,"y":988,"width":20,"height":28},{"text":"kHz(4,()0()","x":769,"y":987,"width":168,"height":35},{"text":"Hz","x":952,"y":988,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"혹은","x":1013,"y":984,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"초당","x":1099,"y":984,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"4,(脚사이클)","x":1182,"y":984,"width":210,"height":40},{"text":"폭을","x":1408,"y":986,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"갖는다.","x":1496,"y":986,"width":113,"height":37},{"text":"이런","x":1629,"y":986,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"대역의","x":1715,"y":987,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"폭을","x":1832,"y":990,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"대역폭(bandwidth)이라고 한다. FM 라디오 방송도 88 MHz와 108 MHz 사이의 주","words":[{"text":"대역폭(bandwidth)이라고","x":546,"y":1043,"width":417,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":978,"y":1044,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"FM","x":1072,"y":1049,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"라디오","x":1146,"y":1045,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"방송도","x":1266,"y":1045,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"88","x":1386,"y":1050,"width":38,"height":29},{"text":"MHz와","x":1440,"y":1047,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"108","x":1579,"y":1051,"width":54,"height":28},{"text":"MHz","x":1650,"y":1051,"width":82,"height":28},{"text":"사이의","x":1749,"y":1048,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"주","x":1866,"y":1052,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"파수 스펙트럼을 공유(각 방송국은 특정 주파수 대역을 할당받음)하는 데 FDM을 사","words":[{"text":"파수","x":543,"y":1105,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"스펙트럼을","x":628,"y":1104,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"공유(각","x":817,"y":1104,"width":119,"height":39},{"text":"방송국은","x":952,"y":1104,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"특정","x":1106,"y":1106,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"주파수","x":1192,"y":1106,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"대역을","x":1315,"y":1106,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"할당받음)하는","x":1436,"y":1107,"width":227,"height":38},{"text":"데","x":1680,"y":1107,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"FDM을","x":1730,"y":1109,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"사","x":1866,"y":1110,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"용한다.","words":[{"text":"용한다.","x":541,"y":1165,"width":112,"height":38}]},{"text":"TDM 링크의 경우는 시간을 일정 주기의 프레임으로 구분하고 각 프레임은 고정","words":[{"text":"TDM","x":608,"y":1230,"width":88,"height":29},{"text":"링크의","x":715,"y":1225,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"경우는","x":833,"y":1225,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"시간을","x":951,"y":1225,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"일정","x":1072,"y":1227,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"주기의","x":1154,"y":1227,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"프레임으로","x":1275,"y":1227,"width":177,"height":36},{"text":"구분하고","x":1467,"y":1227,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":1626,"y":1227,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"프레임은","x":1675,"y":1227,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"고정","x":1831,"y":1230,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"된 수의 시간 슬롯으로 나뉜다. 네트워크가 링크를 통해 하나의 연결을 설정할 때, 네","words":[{"text":"된","x":541,"y":1287,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"수의","x":589,"y":1287,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"시간","x":676,"y":1286,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"슬롯으로","x":758,"y":1286,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"나뉜다.","x":913,"y":1286,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크가","x":1044,"y":1288,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"링크를","x":1236,"y":1288,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"통해","x":1354,"y":1288,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":1441,"y":1288,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"연결을","x":1566,"y":1287,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"설정할","x":1686,"y":1287,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1808,"y":1288,"width":40,"height":36},{"text":"네","x":1866,"y":1289,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"트워크는 모든 프레임에서 시간 슬롯 1개를 그 연결에 할당한다. 이들 슬롯은 그 연결","words":[{"text":"트워크는","x":540,"y":1348,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":694,"y":1349,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"프레임에서","x":777,"y":1347,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"시간","x":966,"y":1348,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"슬롯","x":1049,"y":1348,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"1개를","x":1138,"y":1348,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1238,"y":1353,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"연결에","x":1289,"y":1347,